cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MACH: Machine-Actionable Catalog for Healthcare"
message: "If you use this catalog, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ojha
    given-names: Priyanka
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6844-6493"
repository-code: "https://github.com/FORSE-H/MACH"
url: "https://forse-h.github.io/MACH"
abstract: >
  An open, machine-actionable catalog of open-source healthcare software,
  AI/ML models, clinical standards, datasets, tooling, and MCP servers —
  curated for humans, queryable by agents. Every entry is a structured
  JSON-LD record aligned with established open metadata standards
  (CodeMeta, MLDCAT-AP, Croissant, DCAT-AP).
keywords:
